msgid "Using OpenTelemetry Metrics"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This guide explains how your Quarkus application can utilize https://opentelemetry.io/[OpenTelemetry] (OTel) to provide\n"
"metrics for interactive web applications."
msgstr ""

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "Essa tecnologia é considerada {extension-status}."

msgid ""
"In _preview_, backward compatibility and presence in the ecosystem is not guaranteed.\n"
"Specific improvements might require changing configuration or APIs, and plans to become _stable_ are under way.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr ""

msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr "Para obter uma lista completa de possíveis status, consulte nosso https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ]."

msgid "This document is part of the xref:observability.adoc[Observability in Quarkus reference guide] which features this and other observability related components."
msgstr ""

msgid "OpenTelemetry Metrics is considered _tech preview_ and is disabled by default."
msgstr ""

msgid "The xref:opentelemetry.adoc[OpenTelemetry Guide] is available with signal independent information about the OpenTelemetry extension."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you search more information about OpenTelemetry Tracing, please refer to the xref:opentelemetry-tracing.adoc[OpenTelemetry Tracing Guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Pré-requisitos"

msgid "To complete this guide, you need:"
msgstr "Para concluir este guia, você precisa:"

msgid "Roughly 15 minutes"
msgstr "Cerca de 15 minutos"

msgid "An IDE"
msgstr "Um IDE"

msgid "JDK 17+ installed with `JAVA_HOME` configured appropriately"
msgstr "JDK 17+ instalado com `JAVA_HOME` configurado corretamente"

msgid "Apache Maven {maven-version}"
msgstr "Apache Maven {maven-version}"

msgid "Docker and Docker Compose or xref:podman.adoc[Podman], and Docker Compose"
msgstr "Docker e Docker Compose ou xref:podman.adoc[Podman] e Docker Compose"

msgid "Optionally the xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] if you want to use it"
msgstr "Opcionalmente, o xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] se você quiser usá-lo"

msgid "Optionally Mandrel or GraalVM installed and xref:building-native-image.adoc#configuring-graalvm[configured appropriately] if you want to build a native executable (or Docker if you use a native container build)"
msgstr "Opcionalmente, Mandrel ou GraalVM instalado e xref:building-native-image.adoc#configuring-graalvm[configurado apropriadamente] se você quiser criar um executável nativo (ou Docker se você usar uma compilação de contêiner nativo)"

msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Arquitetura"

msgid "In this guide, we create a straightforward REST application to demonstrate distributed tracing."
msgstr ""

msgid "Solution"
msgstr "Solução"

msgid ""
"We recommend that you follow the instructions in the next sections and create the application step by step.\n"
"However, you can skip right to the completed example."
msgstr "Recomendamos que você siga as instruções nas próximas seções e crie o aplicativo passo a passo. No entanto, você pode pular diretamente para o exemplo completo."

msgid "Clone the Git repository: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}`, or download an {quickstarts-archive-url}[archive]."
msgstr "Clone o repositório Git: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}`, ou baixe um {quickstarts-archive-url}[arquivo]."

msgid "The solution is located in the `opentelemetry-quickstart` link:{quickstarts-tree-url}/opentelemetry-quickstart[directory]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Creating the Maven project"
msgstr "Criar o projeto Maven"

msgid ""
"First, we need a new project.\n"
"Create a new project with the following command:"
msgstr "Primeiro, precisamos de um novo projeto. Crie um novo projeto com o seguinte comando:"

msgid "CLI"
msgstr "CLI"

msgid "To create a Gradle project, add the `--gradle` or `--gradle-kotlin-dsl` option."
msgstr "Para criar um projeto Gradle, adicione a opção `--gradle` ou `--gradle-kotlin-dsl`."

msgid "For more information about how to install and use the Quarkus CLI, see the xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] guide."
msgstr "Para obter mais informações sobre como instalar e usar a CLI do Quarkus, consulte o guia xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI]."

msgid "Maven"
msgstr "Maven"

msgid "To create a Gradle project, add the `-DbuildTool=gradle` or `-DbuildTool=gradle-kotlin-dsl` option."
msgstr "Para criar um projeto Gradle, adicione a opção '-DbuildTool=gradle' ou '-DbuildTool=gradle-kotlin-dsl'."

msgid "For Windows users:"
msgstr "Para usuários do Windows:"

msgid "If using cmd, (don't use backward slash `\\` and put everything on the same line)"
msgstr "Se estiver usando cmd, (não use barra invertida '\\' e coloque tudo na mesma linha)"

msgid "If using Powershell, wrap `-D` parameters in double quotes e.g. `\"-DprojectArtifactId={create-app-artifact-id}\"`"
msgstr "Se estiver usando o Powershell, envolva os parâmetros '-D' entre aspas duplas, por exemplo, '\"-DprojectArtifactId={create-app-artifact-id}\"'"

